WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.039
RUFUS: Gladly. It's structured as a
wholly-owned LLC — limited liability
company. Not

00:00:05.039 --> 00:00:10.079
RUFUS: a foundation, not a 501(c)(3)
charity. Wholly owned means Anthropic
controls it.

00:00:10.079 --> 00:00:15.118
RUFUS: The equity can't be used for
lobbying or political contributions —
that's

00:00:15.118 --> 00:00:20.157
RUFUS: explicitly prohibited. And the
whole thing is pending stockholder
approval.

00:00:20.267 --> 00:00:23.744
JAMIE: So it's a commitment, pending
approval, to a fund they own, to

00:00:23.744 --> 00:00:27.221
JAMIE: do public benefit work with
governance they haven't published yet.

00:00:27.286 --> 00:00:30.074
RUFUS: The governance details are
described as forthcoming.

00:00:30.184 --> 00:00:34.276
JAMIE: And they've separately committed
two hundred million dollars to study
AI's economic

00:00:34.276 --> 00:00:38.368
JAMIE: effects. So this is on top of
that.

00:00:38.433 --> 00:00:40.087
ALEX: What's the stated purpose?
